{'symbol': 'COG', 'date': '2020-10-27 18:52:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROBBINS LLP ANNOUNCES THAT CABOT OIL AND GAS CORPORATION (COG) IS BEING SUED FOR MISLEADING SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "SAN DIEGO & HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $COG #CLASSACTION--SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM ROBBINS LLP ANNOUNCES THAT ON OCTOBER 5, 2020, A PURCHASER OF CABOT OIL AND GAS CORPORATION (NYSE: COG) FILED A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT FOR ALLEGED VIOLATIONS OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 BETWEEN OCTOBER 23, 2015 AND JUNE 12, 2020. CABOT IS AN INDEPENDENT OIL AND GAS COMPANY PRIMARILY OPERATING IN PENNSYLVANIA'S MARCELLUS SHALE. IF YOU HAVE SUFFERED A LOSS DUE TO CABOT OIL AND GAS CORPORATION'S MISCONDUCT, CLICK HERE. CA"}